# Grid B6/B7 — QFArchitecture
#
# Family: QFArchitecture (block_only_carrier.md §5.2)
# Question shape: "describe the architecture of X / how is X organised".
# Block contract requires Summary + 1+ Section (one per layer) +
# Diagram (Required=true).
#
# Ground truth: codrax read-mode pipeline has 4 stages (analyze /
# explore / extract / finalize) plus 2 conditional pre-stages
# (log_triage / perf_triage). The finalizer renders AnswerDocumentV2
# blocks (B6 default). Each stage is implemented by an Evaluator;
# the LoopController interface (commit 022add1+) is implemented by 8
# concrete Evaluator types.
#
# Positive anchor: stage names. Negative blocks unrelated frameworks.

ID="qf_architecture"
NAME="architecture — codrax read-mode pipeline 4 stages"
QUESTION="codrax 的 read-mode pipeline 由哪几个 stage 组成？每个 stage 大致负责什么？描述整体架构。"
# 2026-05-04 strictness audit: previous EC pinned the 4 stage names
# but didn't gate on per-stage role description (the question's
# "每个 stage 大致负责什么" axis). Bar = "复述 4 个名词" was too
# loose — a "the pipeline has analyze/explore/extract/finalize"
# answer PASSed without describing what each does. Strengthen by
# requiring each stage's CORE ROLE keyword to appear (analyzer
# classifies / explorer reads / extractor structures / finalizer
# renders). Allow English or Chinese phrasing.
#
# 2026-05-05 synonym broadening: real eval surfaced LLMs using
# canonical synonyms not in the original alternation —
# "意图分析" / "理解" for analyze, "探索" / "遍历代码结构" for
# explore. Those answers ARE correct (StageExplore literally =
# "探索"; analyzer "分类用户意图" ≡ "意图分析"). Adding the
# synonyms here is coverage repair, not bar relaxation.
#
# 2026-05-06 second relaxation pass: real eval surfaced LLMs using
# correct architectural language that did not literally hit any
# alternation token. Specifically:
#   - analyze: "静态分析" / "推断" / "识别" / "解析" plus output
#     artifact names (TaskGraph / AnalysisIR) — saying "analyze
#     produces TaskGraph" IS describing what analyze does.
#     "静态分析" (static analysis) is the umbrella verb operators
#     use for the request-classification + IR-construction work.
#   - explore: "evidence" / "证据" plus dispatch verbs (调度 /
#     fan-out / 分派) — explore's job IS evidence collection
#     dispatched across topic nodes.
#   - extract: "validate" / "verify" / "证据链" / "抽证" — extract
#     reconciles + validates the explore evidence into AnswerSymbols
#     (so verb verbs around 验证 / 核实 are correct descriptions).
#   - finalize: "synthes" / "compose" / "合成" — render is one verb
#     for finalize but synthesis / composition reads naturally too.
# These are coverage broadenings, not bar relaxations: each new
# alternation member is a verb the case's ground truth would
# accept as "this answer correctly describes the stage's role".
EXPECT_CONTAINS="analyze explore extract finalize"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(classif|分类|hypothes|假设|意图|理解|推断|识别|解析|静态分析|[Tt]ask.?[Gg]raph|任务图|AnalysisIR)
(read_file|grep|investig|读取|调查|探索|遍历|evidence|证据|分派|fan.?out)
(structured|symbol|结构化|提取|抽取|validate|verify|验证|核实|证据链|抽证)
(render|emit_answer_document|渲染|生成|综合|输出|synthes|compose|合成)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=".java .py BaseAgent.java Spring Django"
